Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:10:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 31/41] genFsm: move EP fronthaul control to use common logic
 in wld library

Improvements:
- register FTA handlers for stopFronthaul and restoreFronthaul
- remove internal management of fronthaul while connecting ep and
rely on the native logic in wld library
- only keep stopping fronthaul in case of scanFail EBUSY error,
after trying first to align active hostapd chanspec with backhaul
candidate chanspec.

References: PPM-4222
Signed-off-by: Ahmed Amine HAOUES <ahmed-amine.haoues_ext@softathome.com>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://gitlab.com/prpl-foundation/prplmesh/pwhm/plugins/pwhm/-/commit/08d9287f3f93a945b3257fa3e4f30752279b3cca]
